# The image build reads four files from this directory: the two package
# manifests, the installer, and the entrypoint. Everything else is working data
# (assembled/ is tens of MB of PDFs, staging/ can be 6 GB of downloaded
# matrices) and has no business in the build context.
#
# Whitelist style: ignore everything, then un-ignore what the Dockerfile COPYs.
*

!config/panel_packages.txt
!config/required_packages.tsv
!setup/install_packages.R
!docker/entrypoint.sh
